journey
    title PoRedoImage — Mobile Portrait User Journey (Cognitive Load × System Perf Impact)
    section Onboarding & Identity
      Open app on phone           : 2: Guest
      Hit / with no cookie        : 3: Guest
      Redirect to /login          : 3: Guest
      Tap "Continue as GUEST"     : 1: Guest
      Dev cookie issued (HttpOnly): 5: Guest, S1
    section Image Capture & Validation
      Pick image from camera roll : 1: Guest
      Magic-byte sniff (JPEG/PNG) : 2: Guest, S2
      Frontend form validate      : 2: Guest
      Submit POST /api/images/analyze : 4: Guest, S3
    section CV → OpenAI → Gemini Pipeline
      Azure CV tags + description : 5: User, S4
      OpenAI enhancement of copy  : 4: User, S5
      Gemini image generation     : 5: User, S6
      Result assembled in browser : 3: User, S7
    section Save & Iterate
      Tap "Save to Gallery"       : 1: User
      POST /api/user-images/result : 3: User, S8
      Open BulkGenerate           : 1: User
      10× parallel Gemini calls   : 5: PowerUser, S9
      Stream results to client    : 4: PowerUser, S10
    section Realtime Lobby (opt-in)
      Open shared studio room     : 2: PowerUser
      SignalR negotiate /ws       : 3: PowerUser, S11
      Live cursor broadcast       : 3: PowerUser, S12
      Session idle > 5 min        : 5: PowerUser, S13
    section Logout & Recovery
      Tap "Logout"                : 1: User
      /auth/logout clears cookie  : 2: User, S14
      Reload to /login            : 1: User

    %% Performance score legend (1 = trivial impact, 5 = heavy / SLA risk)
    %% S1  cookie issue           < 50 ms
    %% S2  magic-byte validate    < 5 ms client-side
    %% S3  BFF request hop        p50 30 ms
    %% S4  CV AnalyseAsync        p50 1.8 s, p95 4.5 s
    %% S5  OpenAI enhance         p50 0.9 s, p95 2.5 s
    %% S6  Gemini Imagen3         p50 5.2 s, p95 9.8 s — KPI gate (<10s p95)
    %% S7  client assemble + render < 200 ms
    %% S8  save to Table + Blob   p95 350 ms
    %% S9  10× Gemini parallel    p50 14 s, p95 28 s — bulk SLA < 45 s
    %% S10 SSE / chunked stream    p50 1 s
    %% S11 SignalR /ws negotiate   p50 80 ms
    %% S12 cursor 60Hz broadcast  p50 16 ms per frame
    %% S13 idle eviction           back-end timer 5 min
    %% S14 /auth/logout + cookie clear < 120 ms